  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://forgemesh.ai/ontology#invalidMapping">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Records a mapping configuration error on this individual: a value_map entry (or a pre-materialised URI in the gold column) resolved to the property's rdfs:range class URI instead of an individual of that class. The value is the property URI where the bad mapping was detected. This is distinct from fm:incompleteReference — the source value was present but the mapping was wrong. Fix by assigning correct individual URIs in the value_map.</rdfs:comment>
